<title>ST VINCENT: CRICKET-WEST INDIES V SRI LANKA 3RD DAY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES V SRI LANKA 3RD DAY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>third day of the second test between West Indies and Sri Lanka</p>
<p>at Arnos Vale on Sunday.</p>
<p>West Indies first innings 147 (C.Hooper 81; R.Pushpakumara</p>
<p>5-41)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings 222 (S.Jayasuriya 90; C.Hooper 5-26)</p>
<p>West Indies second innings (overnight 19-0): S.Campbell b</p>
<p>Pushpakumara 33</p>
<p>S.Williams c Jayasuriya b Muralitharan  46</p>
<p> B.Lara not out				  30</p>
<p> F.Reifer not out				15</p>
<p> Extras (lb2, nb2)				4</p>
<p> Total (for two wickets)		    128</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-62 2-92.</p>
<p>Bowling: S. de silva 7-0-34-0, Pushpakumara 9-2-42-1,</p>
<p>Muralitharan 12.3-3-35-1 (nb1), Dharmasena 5-1-15-0 (nb1).</p>
